    "description": "The Classic AKM Grip: Laffs Dynamics\n\nExternally mimics the look and feel of common AKM grips; modeled off of the common Romanian reverse checkered pattern. \n\nInternally differs from the OEM grip geometry, has thickened walls for greater durability than if the design was cloned exactly to original grip specs. \n\n\n\nPrinter Used: Ender 3 V2\n\nFilament Used: PLA+\n\nPrint Settings:\n\nExtruder: 218C \nBed: 56C \nFirst Layer Print Height: .20mm \nStandard Layer Height: .16mm\nWall Thickness: .40 \nWall Perimeters: 6+\nInfill: 50%+\nSupport Material Percentage: 18%\n\nPrint the grip upside down\n\n\n\nHardware Needed:\n\n1x OEM AK Grip Screw\n\n\n\nCredits:\n\nProSpaceDog: Used multiple grips for reference, specifically modeled the 3DP design from Romanian \"reverse checkered\" pattern AKM grips. ",
